<SiteLayout path="/about-us" title="Meet Tech Judge | Your Local Technology Team in Chatsworth" description="A six-person team for managed IT, infrastructure and home technology. Meet the approach behind Tech Judge’s work across Los Angeles and Southern California.">
 <PageHeader eyebrow="About Tech Judge" title="Good at the technical part." accent="Care about the human part." intro="We’re a local team of six who take technology seriously without making every conversation sound like a service ticket."/>
 <section class="section light"><div class="wrap split" data-reveal><div><h2>Built in Chatsworth.<br/>Built on the work.</h2><div class="team-facts"><div><strong>6</strong><span>people on our team</span></div><div><strong>4+</strong><span>years in business</span></div><div><strong>35+</strong><span>years’ combined leadership experience</span></div></div></div><div class="prose"><p>Tech Judge is led by Terence Judge and Dennis Badashov. What began with the two of them taking on jobs has grown into a company with a Chatsworth base and a team supporting businesses, properties and homes.</p><p>We look after the computers people work on, the networks their offices depend on and the systems that make buildings and homes work better.</p><p>The scale of the job changes. The expectation doesn’t: understand what the client wants, explain what’s possible and do the work properly.</p></div></div></section>
 <section class="section"><div class="wrap split"><h2 data-reveal>You don’t need<br/>a sales performance.<br/><em>You need an honest answer.</em></h2><div class="care-list" data-reveal><div><h3>We start with your situation.</h3><p>Your location, your systems, your budget and your deadline. If something isn’t realistic, we talk about it before it becomes a problem.</p></div><div><h3>We recommend what earns its place.</h3><p>Not every problem calls for a new system. We consider what you already have and explain why a change is worth making.</p></div><div><h3>We take pride in the finish.</h3><p>Written scopes, organized cabling, testing and cleanup. We want you to be as comfortable with the result as we are.</p></div></div></div></section>
 <section class="section light"><div class="wrap split" data-reveal><h2>A project today.<br/>A familiar team tomorrow.</h2><div><p class="lead">Many of our managed IT clients rely on us as their entire IT department. We support their people, manage their systems and help build out their next office when the time comes.</p><a class="text-link spaced" href="/projects">Get a closer look at our work</a></div></div></section>
 <ContactBand heading="Let’s see if we’re the right team."/>
</SiteLayout>
